85
00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.520
"Saya beritahu awak saya tidak akan melawan."
Tapi jangan risau.

86
00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:11.493
Awak ada saya.

87
00:11:11.573 --> 00:11:13.190
Kami adalah wira-wira sekolah menengah.

88
00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:14.800
Tahniah atas kejayaan debut anda.

89
00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:16.540
- Kesetiaan!
- Kesetiaan!

90
00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:00.790
Kisu.

91
00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:06.390
apa dah jadi?

92
00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:09.360
Kembalikan pemain kawan saya.

93
00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:15.940
ini?

94
00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:19.340
Tapi kenapa awak datang?

95
00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.580
Di mana adiwira?

96
00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:25.780
By the way, adakah anda tahu bahawa...

97
00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:30.080
adakah ia rosak?

98
00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:39.530
Adakah ia rosak?

99
00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:44.900
Lelaki yang menarik.

100
00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:46.500
saya tahu.

101
00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:48.740
Jadi kembalikan.

102
00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:52.310
