108
00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:53.950
Ayuh lagi.

109
00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:55.590
Lagi.

110
00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:56.800
Jom.

111
00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.530
ke hadapan.

112
00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.260
Ayuh, ayuh, ayuh lagi.

113
00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.440
Ayuh, sial.

114
00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:21.530
Hei.

115
00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:24.930
- Ini sahaja?
- Jangan harap.

116
00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.250
Kang Yun.

117
00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:43.080
Kita ingat zaman dulu kan?

118
00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:09.540
Kang Yoongi.

119
00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:11.610
Kita perlu bangun.

120
00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:15.280
apa?

121
00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:16.880
Adakah anda mahu melarikan diri lagi?

122
00:15:17.820 --> 00:15:18.890
Jika itu berlaku,

123
00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.090
Saya tidak akan datang.

124
00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:46.780
Datang sini.

125
00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:11.710
Hei.

126
